# Files left out of `eas build` (scripts/build_aab.sh builds with EAS_NO_VCS=1, from the working
# tree instead of git). Same as .gitignore except that it keeps:
# - .env: the EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are read when bundling
# - msarinc-common/packages/*/dist: the built shared library the app imports (gitignored there)

